  "fullDescription": "Bubbles Procreate Brushes\n\nIt’s so easy to draw bubbles with these magic brushes! Create bubble backgrounds with pen pressure bubbles, draw shapes and letters with bubble pen! Add colorful highlights with special brush.\n\nYou’ll get a lot bubbles with just one move. Each bubble has a new color for natural effect. Also single bubble brush draw colorful bubbles with several colors on each bubble.\n\nFeatures:\n– 11 Procreate brushes\n– 2 types of bubble pens for bubble shapes\n– 2 types of single bubbles\n– 6 different bubble effects\n– Special brush for highlights\n– Pen pressure sensitive\n– Easy to draw\n– Video tutorial\n\nThese brushes are compatible ONLY with Procreate application for Apple iPad. They will not work with Adobe Photoshop or any other graphic editing software.\n\nHow To Use:\n– Download the file on your iPad\n– Click on “Bubbles_[by_Sko4].brushset”\n– Procreate will automatically install all the brushes and they will appear at the top of your brush list",
